  "bodyHash": "xoe2TLw6pas=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#008000\">MOA DECOR：花園</span></h2><p><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">這是一個裝飾模組，旨在為您的建築增添新的花園主題物品。目前已有許多家具模組，此模組旨在成為它們的補充，因為您可以找到數百種不同的物件和元素來裝飾您的世界。此模組是</span></em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">MOA DECOR</span></em></span><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">系列目錄中的一個模組。</span></em></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/776/moa-jardin11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1467\" height=\"717\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#008000\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">合成方式</span></em></strong></span></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/755/c-jardin-1.png\"></p><p>模組中的所有物品皆可在生存模式中獲得。若要開始製作這些物品，您需要在工作台上放置一個<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">綠色</span>染料和一顆綠寶石，如此一來便能獲得<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">9個花園寶石</span>。將這些寶石與其他材料結合，就能製作出裝飾物品。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>共有166種不同的物品！</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/758/c-jardin-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"230\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>範例：</strong></span>如果您想獲得獨輪車的模型，您必須先擁有花園寶石，再加上該物品所需的額外材料，此處指的是鐵柵欄、淺藍色染料和一個鍋釜。有些次要的合成配方是來自兩個模型物品的組合。在這種情況下，就不需要寶石，因為在先前的合成中已經使用過了。</span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/761/moa-jardin1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"402\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/765/moa-jardin2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"395\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/767/moa-jardin3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1467\" height=\"557\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/770/moa-jardin4.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/771/moa-jardin5.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/772/moa-jardin6.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/773/moa-jardin7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1467\" height=\"593\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/774/moa-jardin8.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/775/moa-jardin9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1467\" height=\"558\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/777/moa-jardin10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"506\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/778/moa-jardin12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1418\" height=\"863\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/779/moa-jardin13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1341\" height=\"971\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/722/780/moa-jardin14.png\"></p><p><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><u>備註：</u></strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為了獲得更加完整的遊戲體驗，建議您也看看</span></em><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>MOA DECOR</strong>&nbsp;</em><strong><em>系列目錄</em></strong></span><em>中的其他模組，其中包含更多與此模組相輔相成的分類。</em></span></span></em></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></em></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></em></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></em></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></em></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></em></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></em></a></span></p><p><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
